---
title: Example
---

flowchart TD
    Start([start]) --> Check{condition?}

    Check -->|yes| Action[do something]
    Action --> SideEffect[side effect]

    Check -->|no| Warn[/warning: reason/]

    SideEffect --> Ok[ok: done]

    classDef ok fill:#a6e3a1,color:#1e1e2e,stroke:#1e1e2e
    classDef action fill:#f9e2af,color:#1e1e2e,stroke:#1e1e2e
    classDef error fill:#f38ba8,color:#1e1e2e,stroke:#1e1e2e
    classDef sideEffect fill:#cba6f7,color:#1e1e2e,stroke:#1e1e2e

    class Ok ok
    class Warn action
    class SideEffect sideEffect
